d player gap +0.427 in the same direction as the team gap; most star cells are below the n>=30 gate.\n- observed_sample_and_power: 38/94 players at n>=15; only 3 at n>=30 both tiers\n- auto_validation_status: no_validation_recorded; evidence: NOT_RECORDED"}, {"id": "FAM:SF-APPS-088", "score": 0.108, "document": "# FAM:SF-APPS-088 | Study family SF-APPS-088: Offensive-identity resilience: connector absence vs usage-matched others\n- observed_research_question: Offensive-identity resilience: connector absence vs usage-matched others\n- auto_outcome_status: supported\n- observed_hypothesis: Connector absence displaces team offensive identity (D_A) more than usage-matched non-organizer absence.\n- observed_result: Unmatched conn vs role D_A 0.2020 vs 0.1021, t=5.97 p=2.87e-08. Usage-matched vs role: paired dD_A +0.1151, P(conn>ctrl)=81.2%, t=6.35 p=7.35e-09 n=96. Vs terminal: +0.0777 t=2.37 p=0.0261 n=25.\n- auto_failure_mechanism: D_positive (no failure: positive result)\n- auto_limited_by: LIM:small_sample\n- auto_has_risk: RISK:MECHANICAL_FLOOR\n- auto_has_risk: RISK:SAMPLE_SIZE_POWER\n- observed_failure_evidence: Usage-matched connector vs role occupant identity break is large and significant (n=96). Licensed comparison excludes organizers.\n- observed_sample_and_power: n=96 matched pairs vs role; n=25 vs terminal; 908 player-seasons\n- auto_related_family: FAM:SF-PAP-028"}, {"id": "FAM:SF-APPS-009", "score": 0.097, "document": "# FAM:SF-APPS-009 | Study family SF-APPS-009: Player routing V4 vs V5 direct scoring\n- observed_research_question: Player routing V4 vs V5 direct scoring\n- auto_outcome_status: untestable\n- observed_hypothesis: V5 player routing picks players with higher observed PPP than V4 routing.\n- observed_result: 8 divergences, 0 scoreable, 8 unscored (player missing from Neo4j); hit rate n/a.\n- auto_failure_mechanism: A_unanswerable (question not answerable with the data or design)\n- auto_limited_by: LIM:small_sample\n- auto_has_risk: RISK:DRIFT_NONSTATIONARITY\n- auto_has_risk: RISK:SAMPLE_SIZE_POWER\n- observed_failure_evidence: Scoreable 0 of 8; V5 mostly routed to 'team' rather than a player.\n- observed_sample_and_power: n=8 divergences, 0 scoreable\n- auto_validation_status: no_validation_recorded; evidence: NOT_RECORDED\n- observed_method: Series where V4 and V5 routed to different players; compare observed PPP (n>=5 each).\n- observed_verdict: inconclusive\n- observed_failure_type: A_unanswerable\n- auto_confidence: high (0.95)"}], "n_results": 4}

